            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/files",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "files"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Use this action to get a list of files accessible for you to download that contain deactivated phone numbers.\n\n## General requirements\n* **Authentication:** Basic (easiest to implement) or Digest\n* **Encoding:** Accepts only **UTF-8 unicode** characters as inputs.\n* **Responds with:** `application/json`\n* **Rate limit:** Default rate limits by product"
